Totemic Resurgence
    Events
    Conditions
        (Level of RESTORATION_TotemicResurgence  for (Triggering unit)) Greater than 0
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units within 500.00 of (Position of (Triggering unit)).) and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Owner of (Picked unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
                        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                ((Picked unit) is in TotemGroupNazgrek.) Equal to True
                                ((Picked unit) is in TotemGroupZulkis.) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Count = (TotemicResurgence_Count + 1)
                    Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Count Less than or equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Real = 0.00
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Count Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Real = 1.15
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Count Equal to 2
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Real = 1.30
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Count Equal to 3
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Real = 1.45
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Count Greater than or equal to 4
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Real = 1.60
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet TotemicResurgence_Count = 0
